// 3 days/week, ~30 min sessions, light intensity. Equipment: Bodyweight only.
# Week 1
// Estimated ~13 min
## Full Body A
// Arms forward for balance, full depth you can control.
Squat, Bodyweight / 2x8 / 0kg / 60s / warmup: none / progress: custom(maxReps: 15) {~
  if (completedReps >= reps && reps[ns] < state.maxReps) {
    reps += 1
  }
~}
